 little before the time indicated on your\n reservation. 6/Getting in the vehicle\n Indicate your name to the driver of the vehicle and validate your ticket\n.\nAttention! A single piece of luggage with “cabin” dimensions (55cm x 25 cm x 35cm and approximately 12kg) is accepted per traveller.\nTravelling with Filéo every day is so easy!\n\nMore information on the Filéo service by clicking here.","kind":"information","severity":"INFORMATION","cause":"INFORMATION","updatedAt":"20250114T181151","applicationPeriods":[{"begin":"20161103T000000","end":"20301103T235900"}],"impactedLineRefs":["line:IDFM:C01712"],"impactedStopNames":[]}]},{"lineRef":"line:IDFM:C01714","status":"disrupted","disruptions":[{"id":"083d7b82-5ba0-4af2-87fb-cfc3ba01b7f1","title":"⚠️🚍 #InfoTrafic - Line 4240 - Wednesday, August 12, 2026","message":"⚠️🚍 #InfoTrafic - Line 4240 - Wednesday, August 12, 2026\n\n Due to operational constraints, the following departures are cancelled:\n ❌ Pool departures:\n 16:57 p.m., 5:35\n p.m.\n Please excuse us\n for the inconvenience.","kind":"incident","severity":"PERTURBEE","cause":"PERTURBATION","updatedAt":"20260812T165606","applicationPeriods":[{"begin":"20260812T165500","end":"20260812T200000"}],"impactedLineRefs":["line:IDFM:C01714"],"impactedStopNames":[]}]},{"lineRef":"line:IDFM:C01717","status":"planned","disruptions":[{"id":"af3e3e95-a106-4625-807f-2e9b534a41f8","title":"⚠️🚍 #Infotrafic - Lines 702, 704, 704, 706, 706, 706, 706, 706, 707, 707, 707 - Wednesday, August 12, 2026","message":"⚠️🚍 #Infotrafic - Lines 702, 704, 706, 706, 706, 707, 707, 707, 707, 707, 707, 707, 707, 707, 708, 7719 - Wednesday, August 12, 2026\n -\n Due to unexpected work, lines are diverted from The train station in Chelles: ❌ Chelles Town Hall\n stops\n , Carrefour des Déportees crossroads are not\n served Please excuse us for the inconvenience caused.","kind":"works","severity":"PERTURBEE","cause":"TRAVAUX","updatedAt":"20260812T085026","applicationPeriods":[{"begin":"20260812T