dicating your departure Filéo stop and your arrival Filéo stop, you will receive a confirmation of\n your reservation. If your trip involves a connection, book trip 1 and trip 2.\n 4/A confirmation is sent to you\n\nCheck your confirmation reminder showing the exact time of your Filéo sent to you no later than one hour before your trip\n. 5/Go to your Filéo stop 5 minutes before departure\n\nIn order to ensure that your reservation is properly taken care of, please arrive at your Filéo stop a little before the time indicated on your\n reservation. 6/Getting in the vehicle\n Indicate your name to the driver of the vehicle and validate your ticket\n.\nAttention! A single piece of luggage with “cabin” dimensions (55cm x 25 cm x 35cm and approximately 12kg) is accepted per traveller.\nTravelling with Filéo every day is so easy!\n\nMore information on the Filéo service by clicking here.","kind":"information","severity":"INFORMATION","cause":"INFORMATION","updatedAt":"20250114T181151","applicationPeriods":[{"begin":"20161103T000000","end":"20301103T235900"}],"impactedLineRefs":["line:IDFM:C01823"],"impactedStopNames":[]}]},{"lineRef":"line:IDFM:C01843","status":"disrupted","disruptions":[{"id":"3c116831-76ec-46ea-8377-cc6b3458418e","title":"Tramway T4 - Construction: Traffic interrupted between Bondy and Aulnay-sous-Bois from 03/08 to 14/08 from 22:55 p.m., except Tuesdays 4 and 11/08","message":"From Monday, August 3 to Friday, August 14, except weekends, traffic is interrupted between Bondy and Aulnay-sous-Bois from 22:55 p.m.\n\nTrams run between Bondy and Hôpital de Montfermeil until the end of service. They serve the stations between Bondy and\n Gargan.\nThe last tram from Bondy and Aulnay-sous-Bois is at 22:47.\n\nOn Tuesdays 4 and 11 August, traffic was interrupted along the entire line from 9:15 p.m.\n\nThe last tram from Bondy and Aulnay-sous-Bois is at 9:01 p.m. The last tram from Bondy to Hôpital de\n Montfermeil is at 9:07\n p.m. The last hospital tram from Mo